            {
                "comment": "Super funny and sweet professor! Very down to earth and enthusiastic about teaching. I was one of the few students in my class this semester that would regularly show up, and because of that she gave out a lot of extra credit in class toward the beginning/middle of the semester. For a good chunk of this semester, I had over 100% in the class. ",
